WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.365
Guide 4. Give your workbook a home on the
laptop.

00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:10.190
Before we change anything, I want you to
check two things: your file name and where
your workbook is saved.

00:00:10.205 --> 00:00:17.535
If this is already your own Teams copy,
don't make another copy. Just check its name
and location.

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:22.985
For a shared or downloaded starter, we'll
make your own named copy. Watch how I do
this in Excel for the web.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:30.065
I open File, choose Create a Copy, and then
Create a copy online.

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:34.025
Now I'll give the workbook a clear name. My
example

00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:40.930
uses 7T_Aisha_EcoBudget_v1.

00:00:40.945 --> 00:00:43.870
Use your own class and name, not Aisha.

00:00:43.885 --> 00:00:49.505
Next, I'll choose my school OneDrive and the
Computing folder. I'll complete the copy

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:54.335
and check the new file name. This is the
workbook I'll use for the rest of the
lesson.

00:00:54.350 --> 00:00:59.695
Now it's your turn. Check that you have one
named working copy in school OneDrive,

00:00:59.710 --> 00:01:03.245
not only in Downloads. Then return to the
lesson web page.
